    "created_at": "2016-10-03T14:52:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-03T14:52:27Z",
    "body": "Hi annevk. I don't _want_ anything :P i think I'm just suggesting something that could be discussed. Working with adjacent text nodes, normalization, is tedious... to say at least. I do realize people, me included, don't do that very often, but I think that's because API is not collaborative enough, i.e. \"I would rather wrap this in an element rather than venture myself into adjacent text nodes manipulation\". There's a whole bunch of functions that could be added and that I think would be used if they existed. Would them be overkill?\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
